\fs24 This driver supports the 
\fc0\cf0 SMC EtherPower 10/100 B Fast Ethernet
\fc1\cf1  Adapter which is based on the DEC21140A co-processor. The adapter automatically detects the correct data rate, 10 Mbits/s or 100 Mbits/s, and also whether full or half duplex is in use.\

\fs16 \
